# GPForum command-line messages, English.
# SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Giacomo Picchiarelli
# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
#
# What GPForum says to an operator at the command line, at start-up and in
# the log; the forum's own pages read locale/*.po. Each message's msgctxt is
# the key the code asks for and its msgid is the English text; msgstr is what
# an operator whose LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES or LANG names this language reads.
# {name} placeholders are filled in by GPForum::Config::Report. The English
# of the config.* keys is also in that module, and t/462 keeps them equal.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: GPForum\n"
